<title>UK: Deutsche unit adds 500 mln DEM to zero coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit adds 500 mln DEM to zero coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, launched on Tuesday has been increased by 500 million marks to 1.5 bln marks, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>There is a new issue price.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    28.OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  13.50     PAY DATE    28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
